          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Juc Thɔɔl kɛ ji̱ A-mon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Na-ɣac raan A-mon Ya-bec-gil-yad ben göl. Kä cu ji̱ Ya-bec diaal Na-ɣac jiök i̱, “Mat ruac kɛ kɔ kɛ ɣöö ba̱kɔ ji̱ ku lɛ lätikä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Ɣän bä ruac mat kɛ yɛ kɛ ɣöö bä wäŋ cuëcnikun diaal lo̱o̱l raar kä yɛn diaal kɛ ɣöö bɛ cua̱ pöc kä I-thɛ-rɛl kɛɛliw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth Ya-bec ɛ jiök, “Moc nɛy kɛ ni̱n bärɔw kɛ ɣöö ba̱kɔ naath jäk kä I-thɛ-rɛl kɛɛliw. Mi wee wä thil ram mi luäk nɛy. Ba̱kɔ rɔ ben ka̱m ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ja̱a̱k ben kä Giba wec Thɔɔl, cukɛ thok la̱t naath. Kä cu nɛy diaal wiee kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Thɔɔl bëë pur ka̱a̱kni kɛ thääkɛ. Kä Cuɛ wee i̱, “Ɛŋu mi wiee kɛ naath?” Kä cukɛ jɛ la̱t min ca lat ɛ ji̱ Ya-bec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu buɔ̱m yieekä Kuɔth Nhial ben kä Thɔɔl min cɛ rieet ti̱ti̱ liŋ, kä cuɛ kɛ̈c ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thääk da̱ŋ rɛw ka̱n, kä cuɛ kɛ ŋuɔ̱k ni dhoon kä cuɛ kɛ jäk kä rɛy wi̱i̱ni I-thɛ-rɛl diaal kɛ tet ja̱a̱kni wee i̱, “Mi wee wä tekɛ ram mi /ci Thɔɔl kɛnɛ Tha-muɛl guur, ba thääkɛ la̱t ni nɔ!” Kä cu naath dual kɛ Kuɔth Nhial, cukɛ ben raar ce̱tkɛ ram kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Thɔɔl kɛ dol kä Bɛ-dhɛk, cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl a nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti kur diɔ̱k, kä cu ji̱ Juda a nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ ja̱a̱k tëë ci ben jiök i̱, “Jiökɛ ji̱ Ya-bec-gil-yad i̱, ‘Ruun kɛ cäŋ däär ba yɛ luäk.’ ” Mëë ci ja̱a̱k ɛ ben la̱t ji̱ Ya-bec, cu lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ cukɛ wee i̱, “Iruun ba̱kɔ rɔ ka̱m yɛ, kä bia nɛy lät kä mɔ gɔaa ɔ waaŋdun.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ruɔ̱ndɛ cu Thɔɔl naath dääk kä bun diɔ̱k. Kä kɛ runwaŋ cukɛ ji̱ A-mon ma̱k, cukɛ kɛ näk amäni cäŋ däär. Kä tëë cu kään cukɛ däk piny, a bɛ thil nɛɛ rɛw ti te kɛɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuëny Thɔɔl ala kuäär",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl Tha-muɛl jiök i̱, “Ɛŋa ɛn nëë ri̱t i̱, ‘/Ci Thɔɔl bia̱ kuäära?’ Käm nikɛ nɛy, kɛ ɣöö ba̱kɔ kɛ näk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl wee i̱, “Thilɛ ram mi ba näk ɛn walɛ, kɛ ɣöö ɛ cäŋ mi ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ kän ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl naath jiök i̱, “Bia wanɛ kä Gil-gal banɛ kuäär wä nyɔk kɛ lätni thi̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal wä kä Gil-gal, kä cukɛ Thɔɔl jak kä kuäär nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, kä cukɛ muc malä thöp Kuoth Nhial ɛn wi̱ni, kä cu Thɔɔl kɛnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth ɛlɔ̱ŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
